# Lakehouse Claude Analytics

A medallion-architecture data pipeline on Databricks (Free Edition) with a small Claude-powered text-to-SQL assistant on top of the Gold tables. CI runs on GitHub Actions.

> Status: work in progress. Sections marked TODO are filled in as each phase is completed.

## Architecture

TODO: add architecture diagram (`docs/architecture.png`).

```
Source data -> Bronze (raw Delta) -> Silver (cleaned, validated) -> Gold (business aggregates)
                                                                        |
                                                  Databricks SQL dashboard + Claude text-to-SQL
```

## Tech stack

- Databricks Free Edition, PySpark, Delta Lake, Unity Catalog
- Claude API (Anthropic SDK) for text-to-SQL
- pytest and ruff for tests and linting
- GitHub Actions for CI

