## Project structure

```
.
├── src/
│   ├── transforms/        # pure PySpark/Python transform functions
│   └── agent/             # Claude text-to-SQL script
├── notebooks/             # Bronze, Silver, Gold notebooks
├── tests/                 # pytest unit tests
├── docs/                  # architecture diagram, screenshots
├── .github/workflows/     # CI workflow
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md
```

## Layers

| Layer | What it does | Table(s) |
|-------|--------------|----------|
| Bronze | Loads raw data as-is into Delta | TODO |
| Silver | Deduplicates, fixes types, applies data quality rules | TODO |
| Gold | Business aggregates, for example trips per zone per day | TODO |

